title: "TorchTangents: Infinite-Width Neural Networks and Neural Tangent Kernels in PyTorch"
abstract: "A PyTorch-native port and extension of Google's JAX Neural Tangents library, providing exact infinite-width NNGP and NTK kernel computation, model lifting, and architecture-aware optimization."
